      "text": "Net earnings increased by $1,091 million, or 7.29%, from $14,974 million in fiscal year 2024 to $16,065 million in fiscal year 2025 (Item 7, EP_0013_E01). This increase was driven by the rise in operating income, partially offset by higher restructuring charges, including $801 million after tax related to the liquidation of operations in Argentina (Item 7, EP_0013_E01).",
