      "text": "Cash flow from operating activities decreased by $2,029 million, or 10.22%, from $19,846 million in fiscal year 2024 to $17,817 million in fiscal year 2025 (Item 7, EP_0013_E01). This decline in operating cash flow is a notable counterpoint to the increases in net sales, operating income, and net earnings.",
